     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "li",
     "text": "Keep our team motivated: Knowing we're helping you fuels our work.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Basically, your feedback makes us stronger and helps us create even better tools for you.",
